e. providing first aid to Victims; and
f. reporting to the competent authorities if Violence Against Women occurs in their environment. (3) Community participation as referred to in paragraph (1) may be carried out by individuals, social community institutions, non-governmental organizations, educational institutions, religious institutions, the private sector, and/or mass media.

